Package: CPR
Type: Package
Title: Cointegrating Polynomial Regressions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CPR-R", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "astadamo18@gmail.com")
Description: Estimation and inference for cointegrating polynomial regressions
    (CPR), following Wagner and co-authors (e.g. Wagner; Wagner & Reichold;
    de Jong & Wagner; Veldhuis & Wagner). Provides fully modified OLS
    (FM-OLS), dynamic OLS (DOLS), and integrated modified OLS (IM-OLS,
    Vogelsang & Wagner 2014) estimators for a single cointegrating
    polynomial regression via cpr(), a panel version via pcpr() (mean-group,
    Pesaran & Smith 1995, for any of the three estimators; pooled, de Jong &
    Wagner 2016, FM-OLS only), a choice of kernels and bandwidth selectors
    for long-run variance estimation, an lm()-like formula/data interface
    for both, CT (KPSS/Shin-type) and PU (Phillips-Ouliaris-type)
    cointegration tests, and turning_points()/plot() for EKC-style
    turning-point analysis of a single or panel fit. MOLS remains a
    placeholder for a future estimator.
